---
import { sectionNumber } from '../section-order';
import '../styles/experimental-stage.css';
---

<section class="experimental-teaser section" id="experimentos" aria-labelledby="experimental-teaser-title">
  <div class="experimental-teaser__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">{sectionNumber('experimentos')} / Experimentos · Laboratório visual</p>
    <h2 id="experimental-teaser-title">Entre o luar e a forma.</h2>
    <p>Uma segunda interpretação do terraço da seção Música: o panorama ilustrado continua intacto; em uma experiência separada, o espaço começa a ganhar profundidade e geometria real.</p>
    <a class="experimental-teaser__link" href="/experimentos/">
      Explorar o palco 2.5D <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="experimental-teaser__scene" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="experimental-teaser__moon"></span>
    <span class="experimental-teaser__lake"></span>
    <span class="experimental-teaser__rail"></span>
    <span class="experimental-teaser__platform experimental-teaser__platform--left"></span>
    <span class="experimental-teaser__platform experimental-teaser__platform--center"></span>
    <span class="experimental-teaser__platform experimental-teaser__platform--right"></span>
  </div>
</section>
